Debug.Assert(New_arrListIndexOfX >= Old_arrListIndexOfX);
```

This assert statement checks that the index of x in the new list is greater than or equal to the index of x in the old list. This means that x is either still in the list or has moved to a position equal to or higher than the position it had in the old list.
